title "LogicMonitor and ServiceNow (Fly)"
subtitle "SaaS with Integration to 3rd Party System"
# not modelled: legend, "Updated" date, "Platform Host" heading, version footnote

BC manage-tech: Manage Technology

BA sn-platform: ServiceNow Platform
BA event-mgmt: ServiceNow Event Mgmt
