BA logicmonitor: LogicMonitor

SI yokohama-prod: SN Yokohama Prod
SI event-prod: SN Event Mgmt Prod
SI incident-prod: SN Incident Prod
SI lm-prod: LogicMonitor Prod

TMSO sn-admin: ServiceNow Administration
TMSO sys-monitoring: System Monitoring
# slide reads "Various Tech Offerings Offerings" (duplicated word)
TMSO various-tmso: Various Tech Offerings
TMS app-mgmt: Application Mgmt Services
TMS monitoring: Monitoring Services
TMS various-tms: Various Tech Mgmt Services

CI(Application) mid-app: java@server123
CI(Windows Server) mid-server: MID Server 01
CI infra: Infrastructure CIs

BSO incident-bso: SN Incident Mgmt
BS service-mgmt: Service Mgmt Services
# drawn as a Business Service box named "Technology Portfolio"; unconnected on this slide
BS tech-portfolio: Technology Portfolio
SP end-user: End User Services

manage-tech -> sn-platform
manage-tech -> event-mgmt
manage-tech -> incident-mgmt
manage-tech -> logicmonitor

event-mgmt -> sn-platform
incident-mgmt -> sn-platform

sn-platform -> yokohama-prod
event-mgmt -> event-prod
incident-mgmt -> incident-prod
logicmonitor -> lm-prod

event-prod -> yokohama-prod
event-prod -> incident-prod : Creates Incident
# SG Connector (Service Graph Connector/API)
lm-prod -> event-prod : Sends data to

sn-admin -> yokohama-prod
sn-admin -> app-mgmt
